 "text": "Hey there! How's your day? Cool boxes are the easiest. A big box with ice at the bottom, your drinks on top, and another layer of ice on top of them. A bottle can work if you refill it quickly. Pour a little out into a refillable glass, and then put the bottle back on top of the ice. It does, as long as you' not leaving it out in the sun. Shade is your friend. Let them have one with their name on it, usually in a different color so they don't all blend together.",
